square roots, the singular values of Lambda on the tangent space are
0, 1, sqrt(5/2), sqrt3, 2 with multiplicities 6, 29, 8, 21, 8.
The smallest nonzero singular value is exactly 1, the first of the
two constants the radius of Theorem (a radius for the rigidity) is built from.

